From 3d1bf3bd507be1671587f128b14215c7f6a7ae6d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Wilderness01 <140787484+Wilderness01@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 02:35:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] iOS: Odyssey pill touch layout, bundled button art, backdrop
 on by default
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Combines 0098 (per-game touch-button skin and in-game touch controls) and
0097 (blur-fill the Fit black bars), and replaces 0098's artwork-only skin
with a full geometry redesign for Odyssey (title ID 0100000000010000):

- DmPadGeometry.h / DmGamepad.m: the pill variant — horizontal pill
  shoulders (ZL top-left, L3 small beside it, L below; mirrored right),
  bigger -/+ pills and gear, bigger face diamond, bigger D-pad — gated by
  DmPadOptions.pill, set from the running game's title ID. Every other
  game keeps the classic teardrops. Hit-testing, the fit test, move/clamp
  and the arrangement step (now a fixed 13.5u) follow the new shapes.
- DmTouchSkin.h/.m: the art is read from the framework bundle
  (TouchSkin/<title ID>/<name>.png), 16 PNGs bundled as resources, so it
  works with nothing but the IPA installed. DM_TOUCH_SKIN auto/off still
  toggles it; the gear menu's Icons row still shows only when art exists.
- DM_PICTURE_BACKDROP (0097) is on by default; DM_PICTURE_BACKDROP=0 turns
  it off. The gear menu's Size / Icons / Move buttons… controls and the
  per-game persistence from 0098 are unchanged.

Supersedes the standalone 0098 patch and the 0097 draft.

Upstream-Status: fork-only
Reason: Odyssey-only touch layout and bundled button art for the shell app, plus a blur-fill backdrop; not intended for upstream.
Issue: Wilderness01/NX2Apple#1
